  <!-- EN: This landform is provided by the mod "{0}". By default, when you make changes to this landform, they will be saved in your personal config folder, while the original file in the mod folder stays untouched. This has the advantage that your changes will not be overridden when the mod is updated, for example through Steam.\n\nHowever, if you are a mod developer working on "{0}", you probably want to apply your changes to the original file in the mod's folder, so that you can commit it via Git, or push out the changes as part of an update of your mod. Apply your changes to the original file in the mod folder now? -->
  <GeologicalLandforms.Editor.ConfirmSaveInMod>此地图元素来自Mod“{0}”。当你编辑更改了此地图元素时，默认会保存至你的个人配置文件夹中，而原始文件则不会变化。这种处理方式的优点在于，当原Mod更新时，你所做的编辑更改不会被覆盖掉。\n\n但如果你是Mod“{0}”的开发者，想要将所做的编辑更改应用至原始文件的话，可以使用Git来提交Pr，或者通过接下来的操作进行合并。\n\n是否要直接将更改应用至Mod文件夹内的原始文件？</GeologicalLandforms.Editor.ConfirmSaveInMod>
  
